This product includes software and configuration developed as an extension
of RMalone8/llm-d-sc-demo (Praxis + llm-d-sc + trace UI).

It deploys and measures third-party components including Praxis
(praxis-proxy/ai, Apache-2.0), llm-d-sc (llm-d-incubation/
llm-d-semantic-classifier, Apache-2.0), vLLM, and NVIDIA OpenShell/OpenClaw.
